  "qualifications": [
    "Native keyposes are newly generated art, not extracted official game animation cycles. MSX-inspired clusters are not certified exact hardware graphics.",
    "Mechanical Snake/Ocelot are authored unmanned reinterpretations; no human face/hair/limb motifs. Double Tripod coat is an original two-unit MGR adaptation, not canon attested three-unit MGS4 appearance.",
    "Mastiff2.8m and Slider1.5m remain estimated dimensions. Gameplay values are adaptations. All new native sheets are full body rather than independently destructible multipart rigs.",
    "Watcher/Grabber/Fenrir remain inactive until complete unambiguous original-source bodies are inspected. Native wardrobe, period-canonical alternatives and rig refinements remain separate backlog.",
    "Historical source atlas bytes are retained. Other ages stay separate fighter identities. New accepted tool image aliases resolve byte-exact to regular application PNG, qualified as local storage sharing."
  ]
